# D3-AD-004: Two fresh adsorption stages versus one larger stage
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 methyl_orange 0.02g
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.20g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 methyl_orange 0.02g
add v2 activated_charcoal 0.10g
filter v1 v3
filter v2 v4
add v4 activated_charcoal 0.10g
filter v4 v5
measure v3 uvvis
measure v5 uvvis
inspect
